<title>HONG KONG: Templeton managed funds surpass US$10 bln.</title>
<headline>Templeton managed funds surpass US$10 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Templeton Asset Management Ltd said on Monday assets managed by its emerging markets team surpassed US$10 billion for the first time in October.</p>
<p>The sum is managed through investments in more than 670 listed securities of companies in 37 emerging market countries, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
